"text":"position to the end, and a page for each page holding a listed element; positions before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first listed one cost nothing. An end is implausible when that span is more than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"16 × count + 64","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" pages, where "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the number of vertices (or edges) listed: at most"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"16 page table entries per listed element (about 2 KB for a vertex, 256 bytes for an edge)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plus 64. So "},{"code":"\"vertexEnd\": 4611686018427387903","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with no vertices decodes, in O(1), while a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"payload cannot make decoding allocate without limit. A graph that has run more than that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"many empty pages past its live elements does not round-trip."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/stablegraphs\/stabledirectedgraph\/init(from:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/StableGraphs\/documentation\/StableGraphs\/StableDirectedGraph\/init(from:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Decodes the format ","type":"text"},{"code":"encode(to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" writes, every position and both ends restored. Throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"DecodingError.dataCorrupted","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for a positions\/values count mismatch, a repeated vertex,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"positions that do not strictly increase or that reach past their end, an odd-length edge","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"list, an endpoint out of range, or an implausible end.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"m